'''Low Tide Beach''' (ずんどこ海水浴場, ''Zundoko Kaisuiyokujō'') is the 16th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 9th sub-chapter in the Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This is generally considered the hardest sub-chapter up to this point. One of the hardest stages is [[Beached Mammals]], which features a [[Bore]], [[J.K. Bun Bun]] and [[Bun Bun Black]]. Another one of the hardest stages could be [[Star Ocean]], because it features the incredibly annoying [[H. Nah]] along with spamming [[Doge Dark]]s that grow more and more powerful as time goes on.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|200}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[H. Nah]]: A mid-ranged enemy that has fair health, decent damage and 5 knockbacks. He also has a guaranteed chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] cats with each hit, making many lower-ranged cats hard to use against him.

